## 1. R2 Storage Integration

R2 client exists ([lib/storage.ts](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/lib/storage.ts)) but is unused. Wire it into all file upload points.

**R2 Bucket Folder Structure:**
```
bbc-church/
├── profiles/        ← Member profile photos
├── visitors/        ← Visitor card images
├── sketches/        ← Activity/misc sketches
├── id-cards/        ← Generated ID card PNGs
├── statements/      ← Generated PDF statements
├── imports/         ← Uploaded TSV import files
├── exports/         ← Generated TSV export files
└── backups/         ← System backups
```

#### [MODIFY] [MemberProfile.tsx](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/views/MemberProfile.tsx)
- Wire [uploadFile(file, 'profiles')](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/lib/storage.ts#23-41) into the photo upload handler
- On delete member, call [deleteFile()](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/lib/storage.ts#42-58) to clean R2
- Add an "Attach Picture" button for uploading additional photos/documents

#### [MODIFY] [VisitorForm.tsx](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/views/VisitorForm.tsx)
- Add visitor card image upload via [uploadFile(file, 'visitors')](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/lib/storage.ts#23-41)

#### [MODIFY] [Activities.tsx](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/views/Activities.tsx)
