## 5. TSV Import/Export

#### [NEW] [DataImportExport.tsx](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/views/DataImportExport.tsx)
- Two tabs: **Members** / **Financial**
- Each tab: Template Download → File Picker → Parse → Validate → Preview → Confirm → Insert
- Export: Query → Format TSV → Download

**Member template:**
`first_name	middle_name	surname	name_ext	date_of_birth	gender	address	contact_number	email	salvation_date	baptism_date	membership_status`

**Financial template:**
`member_surname	member_first_name	transaction_date	tithe	faith_promise	love_gift	pledge	pledge_purpose`

