## 6. Role-Based Access (Foundation)

Define roles for future enforcement:

| Role | Access |
|------|--------|
| Super Admin | Full system access |
| Church Clerk | Members, visitors, services, attendance |
| Treasurer | Financial records, statements, import/export |
| Music Minister | Music ministry, choir/ensemble attendance |
| SS Teacher (Adult) | Adult department attendance & records |
| SS Teacher (Children) | Children, Beginners, Nursery/Primary, Junior |
| Activity Coordinator | Good News Class, Soul Winning, Bible Studies, Outreach |
| Member | View own profile only |

#### [NEW] [RoleManagement.tsx](file:///c:/Users/eds04/Downloads/Church%20System/Final%20Church%20Management/src/views/RoleManagement.tsx)
- User list with role assignments
- Role-based sidebar filtering (future phase)

